<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz to launch $500 mln five-yr bond.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz to launch $500 mln five-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Landesbank Rheinland-Pfalz is expected to launch a $500 million five-year Euro-Asian bond on Wednesday, joint lead managers IBJ and Merrill Lynch said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The deal would be priced to yield 15 basis points over U.S. Treasury notes, the lead managers said.</p>
<p>LB Rheinland-Pfalz is rated Aa1 by Moody's Investors Service and AA plus by Standard &amp; Poor's.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
